{"3659990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "hate.net", "steam_appid": 3659990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/3cfb5577a4734b62e8ecdbf497de3229.webp?t=1783936701\" width=167 height=35 /></span> a minimalistic <strong>FPS movement shooter. </strong>An energy drink-sized time capsule of endless fighting. A micro-world of bots in a perpetual state of meaningless conversation with each other. Stay as long as you like - they've fought long before you, and they'll fight long after you're gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/bdc4a22b0e2934c313872e56fd687ab7.webp?t=1783936701\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/938c10e29c695571c3f83faa8d3b8181.poster.avif?t=1783936701\" width=690 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/938c10e29c695571c3f83faa8d3b8181.webm?t=1783936701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/938c10e29c695571c3f83faa8d3b8181.mp4?t=1783936701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a simple and responsive player moveset, featuring sliding, jumping, and a double-jump that allows you to redirect your velocity. Kill enemies with your sword and gun and find unique interactions hidden in these mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\